# Syncthing ignore patterns for the webhosting Syncthing share
# Covers webhosting/ and everything under it (including SchmidtWorx/)
# Created 2026-05-21 after a sync-conflict storm corrupted .git/
#
# CRITICAL: never sync the git database across devices. Git already
# handles cross-machine sync via push/pull. Syncing .git/ in parallel
# guarantees conflicts on objects, refs, index, packed-refs, etc.

.git
.git/**

# Transient editor / tool state
.aider*
.DS_Store
.vscode
.idea
*.swp
*.swo

# Sync-conflict files themselves — never propagate them
(?d)*sync-conflict-*
